msgid "Win rates from tournament records (a tie counts half), with Mega forms resolved from held stones — Charizard-Mega-Y and -X count separately. Only Pokémon with at least %(min_games)s games and %(min_teams)s teams are ranked (%(qualified)s qualify). The underperforming list is limited to Pokémon with at least %(min_usage)s%% usage."
msgstr "Las tasas de victoria provienen de los resultados de torneos (un empate cuenta la mitad), con las formas Mega resueltas por las piedras equipadas — Charizard-Mega-Y y -X cuentan por separado. Solo se clasifican los Pokémon con al menos %(min_games)s partidas y %(min_teams)s equipos (%(qualified)s califican). La lista de bajo rendimiento se limita a Pokémon con al menos %(min_usage)s%% de uso."

